title: "Scientific AI Engineering Curriculum: Building Performance Simulation with Machine Learning"
abstract: "A comprehensive 600-700 hour open-source curriculum covering Scientific AI Engineering applied to Building Performance Simulation. Includes 132+ exercises across 12 months, covering Physics-Informed Machine Learning, Large Language Models, RAG, Production Deployment, and Advanced Optimization."
